      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear you about the dose but i really need the pain gone. if i just take it with a big meal like a sandwich or something, isn't the food enough to stop it from hurting my stomach? since i'm already taking the omeprazole to protect my stomach, shouldn't i be fine to just take regular doses of advil for a few days until i can see a dentist?",
